<section class="three-tool-knowledge" id="hifz-guide-guide" aria-labelledby="hifz-guide-heading">
<h2 id="hifz-guide-heading">Quran Hifz Tracker: memorisation goals, revision and a complete guide</h2>
<p><strong>Short answer:</strong> A Hifz planner tracks a chosen Surah's ayah range and how many verses you have personally marked as memorised. A sustainable goal combines <strong>new memorisation, recent revision and older revision</strong>. This tool validates verse ranges for a curated eleven-Surah list, stores progress locally and offers optional JSON backup; it cannot verify recitation or retention.</p>
